	)
	(text_box "16 isolated PLC field positions use software-remapped logical channels to minimize PCB crossings. The dedicated E-stop optochannel is separate from the shift-register bits. PLC and control channels keep the indicator LED, 2.2 k series limit and reverse diode. The LED is placed first so it can sit at the input connector. Every four isolated inputs share one TLP291-4 SOP-16 optocoupler. Four 4x10 k isolated networks provide the PLC pull-ups and no input-node capacitor is fitted. U8 adds eight isolated AX0-AX3 servo ready/error inputs; U9 is the final unisolated byte for AX4."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 15 0.0000)
		(size 190 45)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0.127)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "846eedae-7d28-46da-8809-7eb0c57d86ac")
	)
	(text_box "The dedicated E-stop uses one TLP291 SOP-4 optocoupler and R74. PLC inputs use four TLP291-4 packages with two 8x10 k pull-up networks. Every field input uses the same connector-side indicator LED / 2.2 k / reverse-diode chain. Firmware provides debouncing."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 205 0.0000)
		(size 250 34)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0.127)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
